OL,3,GNEWSADigital reconstruction reveals
OL,4,AConquest Man's face
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe face of a man who lived through the
OL,7,FNorman Conquest has been digitally
OL,8,Freconstructed.
OL,10,FThe skeleton of the man, known as
OL,11,FConquest Man, was found buried at St
OL,12,FPeter's Church in Barton-upon-Humber 50
OL,13,Fyears ago, with evidence his burial
OL,14,Ftook place in 1079.
OL,16,FHis remains were analysed using
OL,17,Fosteological analysis, ancient DNA and
OL,18,Fisotope testing.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
