OL,3,GNEWSADigital reconstruction reveals
OL,4,AConquest Man's face
OL,5,
OL,6,FKevin Booth from English Heritage said:
OL,7,F"I was really intrigued by what we
OL,8,Fcould say about one individual who we
OL,9,Fknow lives through that entire upheaval
OL,10,Fand whose face we can recreate pretty
OL,11,Frealistically and look at and think
OL,12,Fyou're just like us, what on earth did
OL,13,Fyou experience?"
